WEBVTT

00:21:29.204 --> 00:21:33.579
Recessions can shape careers in ways that
are profound and profoundly surprising,

00:21:34.371 --> 00:21:37.871
we don't yet know the outcome of this
recession because we're still in it,

00:21:38.579 --> 00:21:40.204
but we can look to past recessions

00:21:40.204 --> 00:21:44.871
for wisdom to guide us through our current
journey. Just ask Emily BIanche.

00:21:45.329 --> 00:21:49.704
I would submit job after job after
application after application

00:21:49.704 --> 00:21:54.538
and would hear nothing. Occasionally
I get an interview and

00:21:54.538 --> 00:21:56.913
I find out eight other people
were being interviewed

00:21:56.913 --> 00:22:01.829
and it was really nerve wracking. It took
an entire year to get a full time job.